.9 时编 v3/v3_fp32/v3_cluster 三组显式实例化 .cu+api.cpp（-O3 fast_math half 操作符解禁），C++20+SABI，PyTorch 2.10 C-shim 目标版本；不支持的架构出空目标。", "tags": ["build-system", "cmake", "deepselect", "cuda-kernels"], "complexity": "moderate"}, {"id": "service:docker/Dockerfile.efa", "type": "service", "name": "Dockerfile.efa", "filePath": "docker/Dockerfile.efa", "summary": "AWS EFA 变体镜像（157 行）：在 vllm-openai 基础上装 EFA userspace 栈（libfabric/aws-ofi-nccl/hwloc，sha256 校验），NCCL_NET/TUNER_PLUGIN=ofi 路由；换装 x86_64 专属 Mooncake EFA wheel（按基座版本号配对、卸载校验防双装）；DeepEP 换 amazon fork 使 deepep_v2 经 NCCL GIN over EFA 载 EP 流量（构建末断言 ElasticBuffer v2 API 存在）。", "tags": ["containerization", "aws-efa", "mooncake", "deepep", "rdma"], "complexity": "complex"}, {"id": "service:docker/Dockerfile.rocm_72", "type": "service", "name": "Dockerfile.rocm_72", "filePath": "docker/Dockerfile.rocm_72", "summary": "ROCm 7.2 主构建镜像（1019 行多阶段）：fetch_vllm 本地/远程双源、独立 rust-input/rust-toolchain/rust-build 阶段产出 vllm-rs（锁 cargo 缓存防 BuildKit 并发写坏）、csrc-build 只 COPY 影响原生编译的文件保 HIP 层缓存、build_vllm 以 VLLM_USE_PRECOMPILED 复用扩展 wheel；另建 NIXL(UCX 源码编译+rocm wheel variant)/LMCache(源码 gfx942;gfx950 offload+objdump 校验)/ROCShmem/DeepEP(--rocm-gfx942-fp8-fnuz-max 224 对齐 vLLM clamp)/MoRI NIC 后端(ainic/bnxt/all)；ci_base 烤入 Rust 工具链+test 镜像+test_smoke 网络隔离冒烟；final 按 INSTALL_LMCACHE 分叉。", "tags": ["containerization", "rocm", "multi-stage-build", "nixl", "deepep", "mori"], "complexity": "complex"}, {"id": "service:docker/Dockerfile.rocm_72_base", "type": "service", "name": "Dockerfile.rocm_72_base", "filePath": "docker/Dockerfile.rocm_72_base", "summary": "ROCm 7.2 长效基础镜像（479 行）：从 rocm/dev-ubuntu-22.04:7.2.3-complete 源码编译 pinned Triton(ROCm fork)/PyTorch(ROCm 2.13)/torchvision/torchaudio/flash-attention/AITER/MoRI/rocprofiler/rocm-runtime，PYTORCH_ROCM_ARCH 覆盖 gfx90a-gfx1201；sccache HIP 包装器目录（不污染下游）、gcc-13；各组件分支以 ARG 钉住。", "tags": ["containerization", "rocm", "source-build", "base-image", "pytorch"], "complexity": "complex"}, {"id": "service:docker/Dockerfile.z